Subject: Lighter matches in Performance Mode
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509

Performance Mode is a host display setting, independent of the [gameplay]
tweak mask (issue #55). In matches it skips purely decorative work: the crowd
impostors (switched off at load), the world NPCs, the drawing of the stadium's
ambient effects, bloom, heat distortion, depth of field and the static stadium
shadow volumes. Gameplay, hazards, weather and their effects, character and
ball shadows and every random number the game or the network shares are
unchanged; menus keep every effect. The guarded hooks exist only in the
opt-in native game module.

